<p dir="ltr"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span><br />
<font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12px;">Is your team calling enough? Are they calling on too much? I've worked with a lot of agents who stress over both questions. Many times they just need reliable and dependable help with working their leads and that's why we developed Lead Connection Service.<br />
<br />
<strong>What is Lead Connection Service?</strong><br />
- Our telemarketing service for EverQuote customers.<br />
- Leads are contacted using multi-touch cadences designed with input from top industry leaders.</span></font><br />
<br />
<font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12px;"><strong>How does it work?</strong><br />
- Our callers work the leads for the first week to generate transfers / disposition your leads by interest.<br />
- People ready to talk to an agent are transferred directly to your lead line.&nbsp;<br />
-&nbsp;Leads with disconnected numbers and other "bad" leads are returned by our callers.<br />
- Leads summary is emailed every morning marking the leads by intent / outcome.&nbsp;<br />
<em>Examples: NAME Transferred (Day + Time), Available to Call, Marked for Refund/Return).&nbsp;</em><br />
<br />
<strong>Why use Lead Connect?</strong><br />
- More at-bats: Your team spends more time selling, less time cold calling, saving you time and stress.<br />
- More binds: Agents on LCS consistently see more success and higher bind rates.<br />
- Custom auto and home lead filters specifically tailored for Allstate needs &amp; requirements.</span></font><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p dir="ltr"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Let me know a good time to chat if you want to learn more!</span></span><br />
